{"id": "15278", "revid": "2248002", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=15278", "title": "Hurricane (Utah)", "text": "Hurricane is a city within Washington County in Southern Utah.\nGet in.\nHurricane is on Highway 9 between St. George, Utah and Zion National Park. From Interstate 15, take Highway 9 eastbound.\nBy bus.\nSalt Lake Express provides intercity bus service.\nDrink.\nFor the nearest liquor store or bar, see Springdale or St. George (each approx. 25 minute drive).\nSleep.\nThere are several hotels and motels in town along Highway 9."}
